  "body": "This came out of the discussion on https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/8442.\r\n\r\n@annevk  noticed that while the [**explicitly set _attr_-elements**](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#explicitly-set-attr-elements) for an element are lists of weak references, the [**cached _attr_-associated elements**](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/common-dom-interfaces.html#cached-attr-associated-elements) are not explicitly specced as a weak reference.\r\n\r\nDoes the spec need to clarify this?",
